### Component 2: Technology Stack Flow (Area 1)
#### [MODIFY] [TechStackFlow.tsx](file:///d:/Portfolio_Anitgrav/components/TechStackFlow.tsx)
- Upgrade the ticker items to include `[Official technology logo/icon] + [Technology name]` using `TechIcon`.
- Maintain the seamless looping stream by duplicating the technology sequence (`stream = [...ticker, ...ticker]`).
- Add edge gradient masks (`mask-image`) in the container so items seamlessly fade in and out at viewport edges without harsh clipping.
- Add subtle hover interactions:
  - The ticker track smoothly pauses or slows on hover.
  - Individual tech chips subtly brighten border and background with a delicate lift (`scale-[1.02]`).
- Preserve accessibility with `prefers-reduced-motion`.

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///d:/Portfolio_Anitgrav/app/globals.css)
- Refine `.ticker-wrap` and `.tech-track`:
  - Add edge gradient mask: `mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 5%, black 95%, transparent)`.
  - Adjust animation timing for smooth, continuous marquee velocity (~45s).
- Refine `.tech-chip`:
  - Subtle dark border (`var(--line)`), background `var(--surface)`, backdrop blur.
  - Hover states: slightly brighter border (`var(--accent)` mix), subtle lift.

